              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Average longitude}&=\\frac{145+153}{2}\\,{}^\\circ\\mathrm{E}\\\\\\text{Average longitude}&=149.0^\\circ\\mathrm{E}\\end{align*}$$",
