              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Average latitude}&=\\frac{1000\\times38+800\\times27}{1000+800}\\,{}^\\circ\\mathrm{S}\\\\\\text{Average latitude}&=\\frac{59600}{1800}\\,{}^\\circ\\mathrm{S}\\\\\\text{Average latitude}&\\approx33.1^\\circ\\mathrm{S}\\\\\\text{Average longitude}&=\\frac{1000\\times145+800\\times153}{1000+800}\\,{}^\\circ\\mathrm{E}\\\\\\text{Average longitude}&=\\frac{267400}{1800}\\,{}^\\circ\\mathrm{E}\\\\\\text{Average longitude}&\\approx148.6^\\circ\\mathrm{E}\\end{align*}$$",
